  "trust_notes": [
    "The two Unified Framework Implementation archives are byte-identical.",
    "GID051 RA13 verifies cryptographically but declares TEST_LOCAL_EPHEMERAL_UNPINNED, IC10 HOLD, QSHRINK HOLD, and authority false.",
    "Conceptual DOCX sources are provenance inputs; the executable registry does not silently treat them as independent empirical witnesses.",
    "KC144_FULL and KC144_NAVIGATION are synthesis inputs, not independent empirical replays.",
    "The V3 query wave writes metadata only; it cannot alter source standing or promotion.",
    "V4 is an executable extension over the same frozen source set and introduces no new empirical witness.",
    "The V4 production bridge-witness ledger is empty; synthetic tests demonstrate mechanics only.",
    "V5 freezes and replays the existing state but introduces no new empirical source or authority.",
    "V5 N5 reconstruction is same-runtime deterministic replay and is never counted as an independent witness."
  ]
